  "thag1.98:1.1": "rūpaṃ disvā sati muṭṭhā ",
  "thag1.98:1.2": "piyanimittaṃ manasikaroto ",
  "thag1.98:1.3": "sārattacitto vedeti ",
  "thag1.98:1.4": "tañca ajjhosa tiṭṭhati ",
  "thag1.98:1.5": "tassa vaḍḍhanti āsavā ",
  "thag1.98:1.6": "bhavamūlopagāminoti. ",
  "thag1.98:1.7": "abhayo thero. 9 "
